# ui.window.title
msgid "Kenshi Job Management"
msgstr "Kenshi工作管理器"

msgid "A window for squad job queues and work stations: who does what, in which order, and who works where."
msgstr "管理小队工作队列与工作站的窗口：谁做什么、按什么顺序、谁在哪里工作。"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Turns the whole mod on or off."
msgstr "启用或禁用整个模组。"

msgid "Open key"
msgstr "打开按键"

msgid "Opens and closes the Job Manager. NONE (Backspace when assigning) - only the button on the panel."
msgstr "打开或关闭工作管理器。NONE（设置时按 Backspace）- 仅使用面板按钮。"

msgid "Button on the panel"
msgstr "面板按钮"

msgid "The JM button next to the game's Jobs button on the bottom panel."
msgstr "底部面板上游戏\"工作\"按钮旁的 JM 按钮。"

msgid "Interface size, %"
msgstr "界面大小，%"

msgid "Size of the whole Job Manager window: text, buttons and cards. 100 - fitted to the screen height; applies the next time the window opens."
msgstr "整个工作管理器窗口的大小：文字、按钮和卡片。100 - 按屏幕高度适配；下次打开窗口时生效。"

msgid "Which station categories the Stations tab shows.\nChanges are saved and apply immediately."
msgstr "\"工作站\"标签页显示哪些工作站类别。\n更改会保存并立即生效。"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "详细日志"

